# Prodigy Education

> Prodigy Education is a game-based learning platform that makes math and English fun, curriculum-aligned, and adaptive for students in grades 1–8. Used by nearly 800,000 teachers across 70,000+ schools and trusted by millions of families worldwide.

Prodigy offers two core products — Prodigy Math and Prodigy English — both free for students, teachers, and schools. The platform pairs engaging role-playing game mechanics with standards-aligned skill practice to drive measurable academic outcomes. Teachers, parents, administrators, and homeschooling families each have dedicated pages, dashboards, tools, and reports.

