## Localization

Prodigy is available in English, Spanish (`/es`), and Portuguese (`/pt`), with content aligned to curriculum standards across North America, the UK, and Australia. Hreflang signals are implemented in page `<head>` on each Webflow page.

## CMS Notes

Dynamic content (blog posts, resource pages, ESA state guides) is served from CMS collections. Static audience and product pages are published as individual pages under the `/main-en/` path prefix. LLM crawlers should treat `/main-en/blog/` URLs as CMS collection items and expect new slugs to be added without notice as the editorial team publishes new content.
